        "text": "=Your Tasks:\n\nSummarize the email given below in one line.\n\nTell me if a reply is needed (Yes/No).\n\nIf yes, suggest a short and polite reply I can send.\n\nPlease respond in the following JSON format:\n\n{\n  \"summary\": \"One sentence summary of the email\",\n  \"reply_needed\": \"Yes or No\",\n  \"suggested_reply\": \"Only if reply_needed is Yes, else leave as empty string\"\n}\n\n\nHere is the email body received:\n\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "needsFallback": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are a helpful email assistant. Your job is to read incoming emails, summarize them in one line, and decide whether they need a reply. If a reply is needed, you will draft a polite response based on the email content. Always draft the response in the HTML format so that it is ready to be sent."
            }
          ]
